  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "6E Rewards XL IndiGo HDFC Credit Card is a co-branded travel credit card designed for consumers who prefer flying with IndiGo. Cardholders can earn up to 5% 6E Rewards on IndiGo spends and redeem them against flight bookings and 6E Prime add-ons through IndiGo at a 1:1 ratio, allowing them to save on travel expenses. Besides this, unlike many other travel credit cards, this card also offers accelerated rewards (3%) on everyday spending categories, including dining, groceries, and entertainment. The card justifies its Rs. 1,500 joining fee by offering an IndiGo flight ticket worth Rs. 3,000 along with 6E Prime add-ons worth Rs. 1,099 for services like priority check-in, complimentary meal, and seat selection. Additionally, travel benefits such as complimentary domestic lounge access (8 visits per year) and a low forex markup fee of 2.5% enhance the card’s overall value for frequent travellers. However, the lack of international lounge access might disappoint frequent international travellers. At this annual fee, many consumers would expect at least a few international lounge visits. If you are an IndiGo loyalist looking for a credit card that offers decent value back on both travel and everyday spends, this credit card can be a great choice. However, if you are not loyal to a specific airline, cards like Axis Atlas or Axis Horizon may offer better overall value.",
