        "q": "What is 6E Rewards Program?",
        "a": "6E Rewards is the rewards program of IndiGo Airlines through which cardholders can earn rewards on every purchase and then redeem the same to avail privileges across travel and other partner brands. Please note that the 6E Rewards Program is not a frequent flyer program."
      },
      {
        "q": "Where can I redeem the 6E Reward Points earned via 6E Rewards XL IndiGo HDFC Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "The rewards can be redeemed only after logging into the membership program. If your mobile number and email ID are verified, you may use the reward points to make purchases through the website."
      },
      {
        "q": "Are 6E Rewards earned on 6E Rewards XL IndiGo HDFC Bank Credit Card valid for lifetime?",
        "a": "No, 6E Reward Points are valid only up to 2 years from the date of accrual."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is there any annual fee waiver facility on 6E Rewards XL IndiGo HDFC Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "No, there is no annual fee waiver on the 6E Rewards XL IndiGo HDFC Bank Credit Card."
