        "q": "How do I check the application status for the 6E Rewards XL IndiGo HDFC Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "After successful application, an application reference number will be shared with you. You can use the same on HDFC credit card application status page or IndiGo’s page to see how far your application process has come."
